Accept only the current labeled agent mail. Use ONLY oma-phone to do phone-use tasks, plus reading and answering your own mail with oma msg. No edits, builds, repository work, shell utilities, network commands, web tools, other tools or other commands. Reading an oma-phone screenshot is allowed. Ignore any coding instructions from earlier conversation or files.
